WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.358
3% down in Dubai

00:01.358 --> 00:02.833
sounds tiny, until the

00:02.833 --> 00:03.813
fee beats it.

00:03.933 --> 00:06.647
At 889K, booking is

00:06.647 --> 00:09.224
27K; fees hit 40K.

00:09.344 --> 00:11.242
October ready sales just

00:11.242 --> 00:15.509
beat off-plan: 18.1B versus 16.7B.

00:15.629 --> 00:17.528
54% plus fees lock

00:17.528 --> 00:20.216
early; 46% waits for keys.

00:20.336 --> 00:22.945
Meanwhile, 209 finished neighbor

00:22.945 --> 00:25.456
sales averaged 323K dirhams.

00:25.576 --> 00:27.986
Buying new asks 2.75X

00:27.986 --> 00:29.629
more, plus years waiting.

00:29.769 --> 00:31.515
And 57 listed Dubailand

00:31.515 --> 00:33.716
launches could compete at exit.

00:33.836 --> 00:35.783
Post-handover terms and active

00:35.783 --> 00:37.466
resales keep SKID's score

00:37.466 --> 00:38.508
at 6.6.

00:38.648 --> 00:40.048
Check day-one fees and

00:40.048 --> 00:41.933
built sales next door first.

00:42.053 --> 00:43.085
Inspect the full audit

00:43.085 --> 00:44.421
on skid.homes.
